          "docs": "To provide KYC data in order to change user from unverified status into fully verified status.  \n\nThe image/document provided us must be hosted in a URL then pass the URL to Xfers via this API.  \nMake sure data type for your image is jpeg / png.  \nMaximum size of the image/ document is 10 MB.  \n\nAfter this data is sent, we will do some verifications on our side and may take some time before user gets fully verified.  In Indonesia, fully verified user will be backed by a savings account.\r\nThus, t"
        }
      ]
